---
layout: base.njk
title: Research
description: Research projects of the Barnard LADR Lab.
---
{% from "macros.njk" import projectTile %}
<header class="page-head">
  <h1>Research</h1>
  <p class="lede">Nicaraguan Sign Language lets us watch, across generations of signers, how a language takes on structure, and what having language does for thinking.</p>
</header>

<div class="project-grid">
  {% for p in projects | where("status", "current") %}{{ projectTile(p) }}{% endfor %}
</div>

{% set past = projects | where("status", "past") %}
{% if past.length %}
<section>
  <h2>Past projects</h2>
  <div class="project-grid">
    {% for p in past %}{{ projectTile(p) }}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}
